        "statement": "VTask.npowRec' 0 m = 1 for all m, regardless of the base.",
        "note": "Standard empty-product convention."
      },
      {
        "point": "n = 1",
        "statement": "VTask.npowRec' 1 m = m; the base is returned with no multiplication performed.",
        "note": "Single-element product is the element itself."
      },
      {
        "point": "n = k + 2",
        "statement": "VTask.npowRec' (k + 2) m = VTask.npowRec' (k + 1) m * m; right-multiplication recursion for exponents ≥ 2.",
        "note": "Ensures the function is a semigroup homomorphism from ℕ₊."
      }
    ]
  },
